	<string>## Usage

Launch an external timers interface via the `timers` keyword.

![Keyword to initiate view](images/about/keyword.png)

![Timers main view](images/about/main.png)

Add a new timer with &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;N&lt;/kbd&gt;.

![Adding a new timer](images/about/new.png)

Restart and remove running timers via their right-click context menu.</string>
